The Cursor package is written against Cursor's public documentation of its
command-line agent: the Agent Client Protocol mode (`agent acp`), the CLI
parameters, the CLI configuration and permissions, and hooks, at
https://cursor.com/docs/cli. It includes no Cursor source and no third-party
source.

Reverse-engineered clients of Cursor's private service protocol are not used,
referenced or ported.

This package is not an official Cursor integration. Cursor is a trademark of
its owner.
